    <item>
      <title>Go Daily Question 018</title>
      <link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_018/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 18:34:52 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_018/</guid>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;What&amp;rsquo;s wrong with the following code?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#xA;&#xA;const cl = 100&#xA;&#xA;var bl = 123&#xA;&#xA;func main()  {&#xA;    println(&amp;amp;bl,bl)&#xA;    println(&amp;amp;cl,cl)&#xA;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Answer: It won&amp;rsquo;t compile.&#xA;&lt;code&gt;cl&lt;/code&gt; is a constant. The address of a constant cannot be taken.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;</description>
    </item>
